Uses: @marketplace/eu-gdpr-privacy-safe@3.1.0

Capability: EU Privacy Safe (GDPR Right to Erasure & Portability)
  Rule: For ANY feature that stores personal user data, provide 1-click full erasure and JSON export with zero stale reads.

  Scenario: 1-Click Right to Be Forgotten
    Given a user with active and recurring todo tasks
    When they trigger a GDPR account erasure request
    Then all tasks in their todo list are permanently wiped
    And any cached views are immediately cleared (0ms stale data)
